      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philmont%2C_New_York",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The arrival of the railroad in the 19th century boosted Philmont’s economy by shipping raw materials and finished goods.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://townofclaverack.com/town-life/villages-hamlets/village-of-philmont/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 56‑acre reservoir was built up the Taconic Mountains to supply water to the mills, cementing the village’s industrial roots.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
