      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philmont%2C_New_York",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Philmont sits along New York State Route 217, a historic corridor that has linked the village to the Hudson Valley for centuries.",
